  "prefLabel": "Rev 901.01 Accumulated profits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 901.01 “Accumulated profits” means the total undistributed earnings of the organization from whatever source derived.\n\nSource. #2758, eff 6-15-84; ss by #2881, eff 10-19-84; ss by #4557, eff 12-28-88; ss by #5947, eff 12-29-94; ss by #6321, eff 8-22-96; ss by #8137, eff 8-10-04; ss by #9658, eff 2-24-10; ss by #9843, eff 12-23-10 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 900); ss by #10211, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13433, eff 8-12-22",
